[39.73902, "o", "  \u001b[2;3mthat matters is not \u001b[0m\u001b[2;3;32m'is it runnable'\u001b[0m\u001b[2;3m but \u001b[0m\u001b[2;3;32m'is it ever *accelerated*'\u001b[0m\u001b[2;3m. Catches the\u001b[0m\r\n"]
